  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nGiven statement :** [(sqrt{256}) ÷ 4]3 + (6)2 - (12 × 8) + 66 + (36 ÷ 12) = 65**\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the given numbers :\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : 6 and 8\n\n[**(**____**sqrt{256}**____**)**__ ÷ 4]3 + __**(8)**____**2**__ - __**(12 × 6)**__ + 66 + __**(36 ÷ 12)**__ = 65\n\n__**[16 ÷ 4]**__3 + 64 - 72 + 66 + 3 = 65\n\n__**[4]**____**3**__ + 64 - 72 + 66 + 3 = 65\n\n__**64 + 64 + 66 + 3**__ - 72 = 65\n\n__**197 - 72**__ = 65\n\n125 ≠ 65 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : 66 and 65\n\n[**(**____**sqrt{256}**____**)**__ ÷ 4]3 + __**(6)**____**2**__ - __**(12 × 8)**__ + 65 + __**(36 ÷ 12)**__ = 66\n\n__**[16 ÷ 4]**__3 + 36 - 96 + 65 + 3 = 66\n\n__**[4]**____**3**__ + 36 - 96 + 65 + 3 = 66\n\n__**64 + 36 + 65 + 3**__ - 96 = 66\n\n__**168 - 96**__ = 66\n\n72 ≠ 65 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : 4 and 8\n\n[(sqrt{256}) ÷ 8]3 + (6)2 - (12 × 4) + 66 + (36 ÷ 12) = 65\n\n[16 ÷ 8]__3 + 36 - 48 + 66 + 3 = 65\n\n__[2]____3__ + 36 - 48 + 66 + 3 = 65\n\n__8 + 36 + 66 + 3__ - 48 = 65\n\n__113 - 48__ = 65\n\n65 = 65 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : 66 and 36\n\n[(sqrt{256}) ÷ 4]3 + (6)2 - (12 × 8) + 36 + (66 ÷ 12) = 65\n\n[16 ÷ 4]__3 + 36 - 96 + 36 + 5.5 = 65\n\n__[4]____3__ + 36 - 96 + 36 + 5.5 = 65\n\n__64 + 36 + 36 + 5.5__ - 96 = 65\n\n__141.5 - 96__ = 65\n\n45.5 ≠ 65 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (3)\" is the correct answer.",
